g04v -- ADVERSARIAL: is Sedna's shortfall STRUCTURAL (orbit-fit absorption) or INSTRUMENTAL (small signal)?
==================================================================================================================

  Sedna: a = 506.2 AU, e = 0.8496, aphelion Q = 936.3 AU, P = 11389.2 yr;  25 yr = 0.220% of one orbit  [g04 quotes 0.22%]
